# bundles.list — several features under one name: vikix add essentials.
# Fields split by |: name, its features (or other bundles), one line about it.
# Adding a bundle records its features one by one, so any of them can be
# removed later on its own.

# name      | features                                                   | about
essentials  | emacs c python lisp                                        | Emacs, and C, Python and Lisp to start with
developer   | emacs neovim c python lisp haskell lua go zig forth ruby sql wasm javascript rust java ocaml julia pascal | Both editors and every language
everything  | developer office printing                                  | All of it, as a full install had before 0.46: developer, LibreOffice and printing
creative    | video graphics blender                                     | Video, pictures and 3D
